 75CU    BE(86KR,XG)                   2013PE03,2010DA06         13NDS    201309
 75CU  H TYP=FUL$AUT=ALEXANDRU NEGRET, BALRAJ SINGH$CIT=NDS 114, 841 (2013)$    
 75CU2 H CUT=30-Jun-2013$                                                       
 75CU c  2013Pe03: {+75}Cu produced by the fragmentation of {+86}Kr on a        
 75CU2c  Be target at 60.4 MeV/nucleon at GANIL. The fragments were separated   
 75CU3c  using the LISE2000 spectrometer.                                       
 75CU4c  The B|r-|DE-tof technique used to identify the fragments.              
 75CU c  2010Da06: {+75}Cu was produced following the fragmentation of          
 75CU2c  {+86}Kr (60.5 MeV/nucleon) beam on natural Ni (thickness 100 |mm)      
 75CU3c  at GANIL, using LISE spectrometer. Also 1999DaZQ thesis related to the 
 75CU4c  same study.                                                            
 75CU5c  The B|r-|DE-tof technique used to identify the fragments.              
 75CU c  Level scheme is based on observation of the two gamma rays, 61.7(4) and
 75CU2c  66.2(4) keV, observed in both experiments with similar decay times.    
 75CU3c  Although 2010Da06 claims that 66.5-61.8 |g|g represents a cascade, the 
 75CU4c  later experiment of the same group (2013Pe03) shows that they are not  
 75CU5c  coincident.                                                            
 75CU2c  From Shell Model arguments, it is considered that the two levels at    
 75CU3c  61.7 keV and 66.2 keV are 1/2- and 3/2- spins but the authors of       
 75CU4c  2013Pe03 cannot decide on the correspondence energy-spin.              
 75CU5c  The 1/2- --> 5/2- transition is E2, the 3/2- --> 1/2-                  
 75CU6c  (or 1/2- --> 3/2-) unobserved transition between the two excited       
 75CU7c  levels is M1 and the 3/2- --> 5/2- transition is M1+E2.                
 75CU cL T$ From time difference between the implantation of the heavy ions in  
 75CU2cL Si detectors and the delayed |g rays detected with four HPGe detectors.
 75CU cL J(A)$ From comparison with Shell Model calculations. No preference     
 75CU2cL between the two possibilities, one excited level being 1/2- and the    
 75CU3cL other 3/2-                                                             
